text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'Attacking creatures get -2/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Bombard deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control with flying get +1/+1.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.\\nDraw a card.', "Destroy target non-Zombie creature. It can't be regenerated. Return up to one target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Each opponent loses 1 life for each creature you control.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Flying', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, lifelink\\nWhen Militant Angel enters the battlefield, create a number of 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance equal to the number of opponents you attacked this turn.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying, vigilance, lifelink', 'Flying\\nWhen Inspired Sphinx enters the battlefield, draw cards equal to the number of opponents you have.\\n{3}{U}: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', "Flying\\nWhen Pilgrim's Eye enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Flying\\nWhen Subjugator Angel enters the battlefield, tap all creatures your opponents control.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{2}{U}, Discard two cards: Return Advanced Stitchwing from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Green creature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, target creature you control gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Lifelink', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Menace\\nWhen Rot Hulk enters the battlefield, return up to X target Zombie cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, where X is the number of opponents you have.', 'Nontoken creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', 'Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: All Zombies gain menace until end of turn.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to Everdawn Champion.', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', "Scry 5, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, you draw cards equal to its power and you gain life equal to its toughness.", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each opponent you have.\\nTrample\\nWhen Avatar of Growth enters the battlefield, each player searches their library for up to two basic land cards, puts them onto the battlefield, then shuffles.', 'This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the total power of creatures you control.\\nTrample', 'When Eager Construct enters the battlefield, each player may scry 1. (To scry 1, look at the top card of your library, then you may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'When Filigree Familiar enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\\nWhen Filigree Familiar dies, draw a card.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Goblin Goliath enters the battlefield, create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to the number of opponents you have.\\n{3}{R}, {T}: If a source you control would deal damage to an opponent this turn, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', 'When Inspiring Captain enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "When Seismic Elemental enters the battlefield, creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Tattered Mummy dies, each opponent loses 2 life.', "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever Howling Golem attacks or blocks, each player draws a card.', 'Whenever Zulaport Cutthroat or another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "You may pay {3}{U} and tap an untapped artifact you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFlying", "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '{1}, Sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{2}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{2}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{3}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Jungle Delver.', '{3}{R}: Gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{3}{R}: Welder Automaton deals 1 damage to each opponent.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.']
flavor: ['"Eldrazi? Ha! Try walking through Zulaport at night with your pockets full. Now *that\'s* dangerous."', '"For the lands you have lost and the beauty that remains, for freedom and the future, we must hold nothing back!"\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Forward! Until the horizon is ours!"\\n—Khemses, charioteer', '"I did not think I would understand the cold filigree creatures of this world, but they too are governed by the laws of nature."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"I do as I please, little mortal. Do go on about your wishes, though—they amuse me to no end."', '"I don\'t need your mage-rings or your mana equations. I call, and the sea answers."\\n—Keyta, rebel hydromancer', '"Improvement is a consequence of practice."\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"In my downtime I used to paint the vistas. Now the vistas disappear faster than my downtime."', '"It\'s the must-have gift for everyone on your list. Get one for yourself, too!"\\n—Chammi, curio vendor', '"Like ribbons of wind and wisdom the coatls fly, twisting mystery into truth, shaping the clouds to suit their inscrutable will."\\n—Huatli', '"Our enemies will soon discover that we are not as meek as they had believed."', '"Ready . . . uh . . . fire!"', '"Some aspire to climb the mountain of Honor. The Benalish are born upon its peak, and from there ascend among the stars."\\n—*History of Benalia*', '"There are so many of them. It seems they\'ve just been waiting for someone to serve."', '"There is no power too great to be used in the defense of our ancestral lands."', '"Though the afterlife, the city, and even the God-Pharaoh himself were one great deception, the ideals championed by the gods remain true."\\n—Djeru, former Tah-crop initiate', '"Trying to stop it would be foolish. If you feel it coming—run!"\\n—Sergeant Ryda', '"Undefeated in battle, she is the shining future our empire deserves."\\n—Huatli', '"Want to sink a ship? Blow a hole in the hull. Want to kill a regisaur? Same answer."\\n—Captain Brandis Thorn', '"We pray to Avacyn on high.\\nOn snow-white wings fearless you fly.\\nKeep safe our souls. Keep safe our lives.\\nMay angels watch us from the skies."\\n—Children\'s prayer', '"We sail. We plunder. Then we dance."', '"You are undeserving of the afterlife. You will never feel the God-Pharaoh\'s embrace."', '"You were keen enough to sink your fangs into us, vampire! And now you\'re afraid of a few little nibbles?"\\n—Udvil "Ratty" Ratlock', '"Zendikar is always angry, though I\'ve never seen that anger so precisely directed."\\n—Nablus, North Hada trapper', 'As patient and generous as life, as harsh and merciless as nature.', 'Benalish citizens born under the same constellations share a star-clan. Their loyalty to one another interlaces the Seven Houses.', 'Each time it is sent to find a safe haven, it takes longer to return.', "Goblins journey to the sacrificial peaks in pairs so that the rare survivor might be able to relate the details of the other's grisly demise.", 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'He grants endless wishes, as long as you always wish for a blade.', "It cares more about preserving the herd's territory than about preserving itself.", 'It wails of buried riches and the souls lost seeking them.', 'Life is such a fragile thing.', "Loyal to a fault, it anticipates its master's every need.", "Most of the constructs the renegades used against the Consulate weren't originally intended for combat. But some didn't require much modification.", 'On Innistrad, Liliana embraced necromancy, honing her powers by practicing on scores of undead—and sometimes the living.', "Pray that it doesn't seek the safety of your lungs.", 'Progress comes at a price.', 'Rest sometimes requires the right prompting.', 'Six feet of earth muffled his cries.', "Some of the thallids that escaped into the fens of Urborg began emulating the Cabal's bloodsoaked rituals in their own peculiar way.", 'The Curse of Wandering leaves only hatred.', 'The angel remembers her past lives like dreams. Her song held up meadows. Her blade drove back darkness. Her wings carried her across the ages.', 'The dead who wander beyond the safety of the city crave only to spread their curse.', 'The earth walks, strongest of all.', 'The evil inside the mountain pulsed at Nissa in a shock wave of madness.', "The remnants of Innistrad's corrupted angelic hosts collapsed to form the Flight of Nightmares.", "The unicorns of Sursi are a manifestation of Serra's joy and compassion. They frolic and dance like children, offering blessings to anyone they encounter.", 'Vampires know blood and the systems that carry it. And they know exactly where to strike to set it free.', 'Vastly outnumbered, the Zendikari found creative ways to even the odds.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Alex Konstad', 'Allen Williams', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Ben Maier', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Donato Giancola', 'Even Amundsen', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Howard Lyon', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jasper Sandner', 'Jeff Simpson', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jung Park', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Zug', 'Miles Johnston', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Shreya Shetty', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yohann Schepacz']
